bin/
!**/src/main/**/bin/
!**/src/test/**/bin/

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# .idea is generated, not authored: the com.drinkit.ide-convention plugin rewrites most of it at
# every Gradle sync. The one exception is the detekt plugin's own project settings, which
# idea-settings has no DSL for, so that single file is versioned.
.idea/*
!.idea/detekt.xml
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

